WEBVTT

00:23:59.356 --> 00:24:00.836
who doesn't have struggles.

00:24:00.876 --> 00:24:05.356
And it makes me feel less alone
when I can recognize that.

00:24:05.396 --> 00:24:08.996
And that's one of the reasons why I want
to keep getting these messages out,

00:24:09.036 --> 00:24:12.236
after having studied thousands of lives.

00:24:12.276 --> 00:24:17.396
And I think the other thing
that it's changed is my own priorities.

00:24:17.396 --> 00:24:19.476
So I realize,

00:24:19.476 --> 00:24:24.716
OK, I can sit here this afternoon
and edit another paper

00:24:24.756 --> 00:24:26.276
or do more work,

00:24:26.316 --> 00:24:29.796
or I can see my friend
who I haven't seen in a month.